  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Culture for Sustainable and Inclusive Peace (CUSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening arts and cultural institutions in order to promote conflict transformation, economic growth and tourism. Benefits practitioners, arts and cultural institutions in Ghana, Mexico, Morocco, Palestine and Zimbabwe. SDG:16,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
